Fixed `prony_methods` with `method="esprit"` missing delayed peaks of non-Markovian correlation functions at any number of modes. The Hankel matrices were truncated to the requested mode count before the SVD, so the shift-invariance solve never saw the late-time signal; the SVD factors are now truncated to the requested modes instead, following [ESPIRAvsESPRIT], for both the Prony and the ESPRIT branches. The mode count is capped at the rank available to the solve.
